# name: test_threat_model_md[threat-model.md]
  '''
  ---
  schema_version: 1
  kind: threat_model
  derived_from: {architecture: bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb}
  threats:
    - {id: TM-01, stride: S, owasp_llm: null, component: C-01, title: One-time code brute force, 
        severity: high, mitigation: 'Five attempts per phone number in ten minutes, then a lockout and a
        429.'}
    - {id: TM-03, stride: I, owasp_llm: null, component: C-02, title: Patient data exposed through 
        move and cancel links, severity: high, mitigation: 'Links carry a random 128-bit token, expire after
        the visit, show no name.'}
    - {id: TM-02, stride: T, owasp_llm: null, component: C-03, title: Forged WhatsApp webhook calls, 
        severity: medium, mitigation: Verify the X-Hub-Signature-256 header with the app secret; 
        reject others.}
    - {id: TM-04, stride: D, owasp_llm: null, component: C-01, title: Spam bookings fill the schedule, 
        severity: low, mitigation: At most two open bookings per phone number.}
  ---
  # Threat model: clinic-booking
  
  ## Summary
  
  The main risks are account-less patient flows (one-time codes and booking links) and the WhatsApp webhook.
  
  ## Threats
  
  | ID | Severity | STRIDE | Component | Threat | Mitigation |
  |---|---|---|---|---|---|
  | TM-01 | high | S | C-01 | One-time code brute force | Five attempts per phone number in ten minutes, then a lockout and a 429. |
  | TM-03 | high | I | C-02 | Patient data exposed through move and cancel links | Links carry a random 128-bit token, expire after the visit, show no name. |
  | TM-02 | medium | T | C-03 | Forged WhatsApp webhook calls | Verify the X-Hub-Signature-256 header with the app secret; reject others. |
  | TM-04 | low | D | C-01 | Spam bookings fill the schedule | At most two open bookings per phone number. |
  
  ## Assumptions
  
  The hosting provider encrypts disks and backups at rest.
  
  ## Residual risks
  
  A stolen phone can move or cancel that patient's bookings.
  
  '''
# ---
