    - `title`: a short name for the threat;
    - `severity`: `low`, `medium`, `high` or `critical`;
    - `mitigation`: a concrete, testable mitigation in at most 1000 characters.
    Every threat of severity medium or higher becomes work in the plan, so keep them concrete.
